<title>USA: La Crescent, Minn., won by Bernardi Securities.</title>
<headline>La Crescent, Minn., won by Bernardi Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernardi Securities, Inc said it won $1.280 million of La Crescent, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.7003 percent.</p>
